00:03:27.375 --> 00:03:29.277
- See you on the
flippity, my funky friend.

00:03:29.277 --> 00:03:30.614
(dinging)
(audience laughing)

00:03:30.614 --> 00:03:31.645
- How do you kill a troll?

00:03:31.645 --> 00:03:32.877
