00:03:41.109 --> 00:03:43.185
- Name three fictional doctors.

00:03:43.185 --> 00:03:45.979
- Doctor Doom, Doctor
Octopus, and Doctor Phil.

00:03:45.979 --> 00:03:48.042
(dinging)
(audience laughing)

00:03:48.042 --> 00:03:49.313
- In the Harry Potter novels,

00:03:49.313 --> 00:03:52.452
what is the recipe for Polyjuice Potion?

00:03:52.452 --> 00:03:54.718
- Okay, recipe for Polyjuice Potion.

00:03:54.718 --> 00:03:57.476
Step one, add three measures
of fluxweed to the cauldron.

00:03:57.476 --> 00:03:59.210
Step two, add two bundles of knotgrass

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:01.558
then stir three times
clockwise, wave your hand.

00:04:01.558 --> 00:04:02.475
Let it brew for 80 minutes,

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:05.016
then add four leaches, then
two scoops of lacewing flies

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:07.018
that have been crushed into
a fine powder, if you will.

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:09.256
Simmer for 30 seconds on low
heat, wave your hand again.

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:10.572
Then three measures of Boomslang skin,

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:12.256
one measure of crushed bicorn horn,

00:04:12.256 --> 00:04:13.406
heat for 20 more minutes.

00:04:13.406 --> 00:04:15.269
Wave your hand a second time,
let it brew for 24 hours,

00:04:15.269 --> 00:04:16.570
then add another scoop of lacewing.

00:04:16.570 --> 00:04:18.557
Stir three times anti-clockwise,

00:04:18.557 --> 00:04:20.241
then add the piece of the
person you wish to become

00:04:20.241 --> 00:04:21.486
and wave your hand one last time.

00:04:21.486 --> 00:04:22.837
Boom, Polyjuice potion.

00:04:22.837 --> 00:04:27.004
(dinging)
(audience cheering)

00:04:34.217 --> 00:04:35.492
- Uh, and finally,

00:04:35.492 --> 00:04:38.028
my stopping by to
administer this test was--

00:04:38.028 --> 00:04:39.643
- A complete waste of your time.

00:04:39.643 --> 00:04:40.476
- Yes.
(dinging)

00:04:40.476 --> 00:04:41.765
(laughing)

00:04:41.765 --> 00:04:42.932
(audience cheering)

00:04:42.932 --> 00:04:45.168
- Let's hear it for JJ Abrams, everybody!

00:04:45.168 --> 00:04:46.823
(audience cheering)

00:04:46.823 --> 00:04:48.073
That was great.

